00:57:26.850 --> 00:57:38.590
<v Man>I hope to hell it was a lot. I hope it was a king's ransom, dude. I hope it wasn't just some chump change. 'Cause I would hope that my friendship is worth 10 grand.

00:57:38.590 --> 00:58:05.100
